<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 28.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 28.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Wednesday, May 28:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,567.30 (1,569.90)	CHF  1,107.30 (1,120.20)</p>
<p>    DEM    923.19 (929.71)	  GBP  2,556.90 (2,575.60)</p>
<p>    ATS    131.17 (132.10)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Tuesday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $13.69 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$ 9.80 million</p>
<p>    Total turnover  $23.49 million ($36.84 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
